  "rarity": "Magic",
  "rawText": "Item Class: Utility Flasks\nRarity: Magic\nAlchemist's Quicksilver Flask of the Skink\n--------\nLasts 2.60 (augmented) Seconds\nConsumes 30 of 60 Charges on use\nCurrently has 60 Charges\n40% increased Movement Speed\n--------\nRequirements:\nLevel: 64\n--------\nItem Level: 83\n--------\n67% increased effect (enchant)\nGains no Charges during Effect (enchant)\n--------\n{ Prefix Modifier \"Alchemist's\" (Tier: 1) }\n23(27-23)% reduced Duration\n25% increased effect\n{ Suffix Modifier \"of the Skink\" (Tier: 2) }\n43(44-40)% less Duration\nImmunity to Bleeding and Corrupted Blood during Effect\n--------\nRight click to drink. Can only hold charges while in belt. Refills as you kill monsters.\n",
